    "text": "live5news.com\nwebsite\nWilliamsburg County, South Carolina\n‘History will be destroyed’: Neighbors concerned over historic land construction\nBy Caroline Spikes,\n4 hours agoWILLIAMSBURG COUNTY, S.C. (WCSC) - Community members are raising questions as a solar panel farm goes up in the rural Lowcountry. After the parent company of Ikea, the Ingka Group, purchased this Williamsburg County parcel of land in 2019, neighbors started to see construction happening on what is an unmarked Native American burial ground.",
